{"id": 5814, "name": "Ingalls Homestead", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.ingallshomestead.com/camping", "lines": ["re located on the land Charles Ingalls homesteaded. With just a handful of sites - 4 covered wagons, 1 bunkhouse, 4 RV sites, and tent camping - the prairie doesn't feel crowded. | | Covered Wagons - Large Covered Wagon $70/night & Small Covered Wagon $60/night | Our covered wagons are based after a sheepherder's wagon and come in two sizes, large or small. All wagons have electricity, screened windows, a small fan, ", "and a roll-out mat for the floor (approximately 3'x6'). | The small covered wagon sleeps three and includes one double-size mat (approximately 4'x6') and a roll-out mat for the floor (approximately 3'x6'). | Bunkhouse - $80/night | If you'd like a bit more space or a real roof over your head, the bunkhouse is an excellent option. It is a simple one-room building that sleeps six and includes a full-size mattress and t", "wo sets of twin-size bunk beds. The bunkhouse has electricity, a small refrigerator, a small microwave, a table and chairs, a campfire ring, and a picnic table. You must provide your own linens and pillows. | RV Sites - $50/night | Our RV sites include water and electrical hookups. We offer 20, 30, or 50 AMP electrical connections. Each site has a campfire ring and picnic table. All sites are back-in; we do not have ", "campfire ring and picnic table. All sites are back-in; we do not have any pull-through sites. While we do not offer sewer connections to the sites, there is a grey water dump station in our parking lot. | Tent Camping - $20/night | Our tent camping is simple. We do not have specified sites. Rather, you choose your own spot in the camping area. The camping fee includes the use of the bathroom and shower facilities. Si", "rking lot to accommodate your RV if you'd like to arrive early or stay late. | Late arrivals are not a problem; please contact us if you plan to arrive after hours for instructions. | Firewood is available for purchase, $8/bundle. | | Our Admission fee and our camping fee are separate. Our admission fee is required if you plan to be on our grounds during our open hours of 9am - 7pm. It is not a daily fee. You pay it "]}, {"url": "https://www.ingallshomestead.com/shop-1", "lines": ["ve adequate space in our parking lot to accommodate your RV if you'd like to arrive early or stay late. | Late arrivals are not a problem; please contact us if you arrive after 7PM. | Firewood is available for purchase, $7/bundle. | We do not offer any food service on-site, but we are only 1.5 miles from De Smet . There are restaurants serving breakfast, lunch and dinner. Our local grocery store is also open 7 days/w"], "via": "CAMP"}]}
